sequenceDiagram
    participant API
    participant Sch as Scheduler
    participant KV as Raft KV
    participant NA as Node Agent

    API->>Sch: enqueue(workload)
    Sch->>KV: list nodes + resources
    KV-->>Sch: snapshot
    Sch->>Sch: filter + score
    Sch->>KV: CAS lease(node, workload)
    KV-->>Sch: ok / retry
    Sch->>NA: apply(spec)
    NA-->>Sch: ack
    Sch->>KV: write placement
